[SPEAKER_07]: Councilor Caraballo said he was gonna be late because he has a steering committee meeting.

7
00:00:16,575 --> 00:00:17,315
[SPEAKER_07]: Councilor Collins.

8
00:00:17,975 --> 00:00:18,275
[SPEAKER_02]: Present.

9
